  "title": "· New Bags | CELINE Debuts the Flair Bag for Fall/Winter 2026: A Study in Contrast ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | CELINE 上架2026秋冬系列全新手袋：Flair 手袋，撞色设计",
  "excerpt": "Celine's Winter 2026 handbags blend archival styles with vintage doctor bags in bold reds and purples.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-05",
  "date_label": "October 05, 2026",
