      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CELINE has just unveiled its Winter 2026 handbag collection, with creative director Michael Rider drawing inspiration from Old Céline archive styles and vintage doctor's bags to introduce the all-new Flair, Trio EW, and Cabas Frame bags. Rendered in rich, painterly shades like chili red, iris purple, and Syrah grape, the lineup makes a bold, passionate statement.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
