      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Equally eye-catching is a purple satin Trio EW, whose smooth, lustrous texture is made all the more alluring by its saturated purple hue. Lightweight and easy to carry, it features a sliding knotted strap that allows for shoulder, hand, or clutch carry.",
