    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Cabas Frame Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Cabas Frame calls to mind the Frame shoulder bag from the Old Céline era. The new version is crafted from soft, lustrous calfskin in a boat-shaped body, with a double-zip top closure for added security. The standout is the Syrah grape and true red combination, where contrast leather trim frames the squared, clean-lined structure like a picture frame, creating striking visual tension.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
